            "row_content": "<p>Estimated tracked shipping prices and delivery times are below. Remote areas may cost more and take longer, and customs, holidays or carrier issues can cause delays.</p><ul><li><strong>USA</strong> (48 contiguous states): US$7.99 (2-5 business days) · US$34.99 (2 business days) · US$39.99 (1 business day) · FREE (spend US$75+)</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Alaska</strong>: US$33.99 (2 business days) · $43.99 (1 business day)</li><li><strong>American Samoa</strong>: US$33.99 (2-5 business days) · $38.99 (1-3 business days)</li><li><strong>Guam</strong>: US$33.99 (2-5 business days) · $38.99 (1-3 business days)</li><li><strong>Hawaii</strong>: US$33.99 (2 business days) · $43.99 (1 business day)</li><li><strong>Northern Mariana Islands</strong>: US$33.99 (2-5 business days) · $38.99 (1-3 business days)</li><li><strong>Puerto Rico</strong>: US$23.99 (2-5 business days) · US$28.99 (2-4 business days)</li><li><strong>U.S. Minor Outlying Islands</strong>: US$33.99 (2-5 business days) · $38.99 (1-3 business days)</li><li><strong>U.S. Virgin Islands</strong>: US$33.99 (2-5 business days) · $38.99 (1-3 business days)</li></ol><ul><li><strong>Canada</strong>: CA$28.99 (2-5 business days) · CA$59.99 (1 business day)</li><li><strong>UK</strong>: £5.99 (2-3 business days) · £6.99 (1-2 business days) · FREE (spend £40+)</li><li><strong>Australia</strong>: AU$11.99+ (3-5 business days) · AU$14.99+ (1-3 business days)</li><li><strong>New Zealand</strong>: NZ$19.99 (4-7 business days)</li><li><strong>Åland Islands</strong>: €9,99 (5-6 business days)</li><li><strong>Albania</strong>: ALL899,99 (5-8 business days)</li><li><strong>Andorra</strong>: €9,99 (4-6 business days)</li><li><strong>Argentina</strong>: US$14.99+ (8-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Austria</strong>: €8,75 (3-4 business days)</li><li><strong>Bahrain</strong>: US$14.99+ (6-8 business days)</li><li><strong>Bangladesh</strong>: ৳1,849.99+ (10-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Barbados</stro