-6 business days)</li><li><strong>Sri</strong> <strong>Lanka</strong>: LKR5000 (8-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Sweden</strong>: kr74.99 (4-5 business days)</li><li><strong>Switzerland</strong>: CHF6.99 (3-5 business days)</li><li><strong>Taiwan</strong>: TW$388+ (5-9 business days)</li><li><strong>Tanzania</strong>: TZS39,699+ (7-13 business days)</li><li><strong>Thailand</strong>: ฿399+ (6-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Tonga</strong>: T$34.99 (8-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Trinidad</strong> <strong>and</strong> <strong>Tobago</strong>: TT$99.99+ (5-7 business days)</li><li><strong>Türkiye</strong>: ₺499.99 (5-7 business days)</li><li><strong>Turks</strong> <strong>and</strong> <strong>Caicos</strong> <strong>Islands</strong>: US$14.99 (6-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Uganda</strong>: UGX54,999+ (7-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Ukraine</strong>: ₴439.99+ (10-12 business days)</li><li><strong>United</strong> <strong>Arab</strong> <strong>Emirates</strong>: AED59.99 (4-7 business days)</li><li><strong>Uruguay</strong>: UYU599.99+ (7-12 business days)</li><li><strong>Vanuatu</strong>: Vt1699+ (15-20 business days)</li><li><strong>Vietnam</strong>: ₫388888+ (7-11 business days)</li><li><strong>Zambia</strong>: US$14.99+ (6-10 business days)</li><li><strong>Zimbabwe</strong>: US$14.99 (6-9 business days)</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gCyPwd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long until I receive my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Your book is made for you, printed on demand. Add the estimated production time below to the shipping time above for an estimated delivery date:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>USA</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>Canada</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>UK</strong>: 2-3 business days</li><li><strong>Australia</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>New Zealand</strong>: 3-4 business days</li><li><strong>EU</strong>: 4-5 business days</li><li><strong>Rest of the World</strong>:&nbsp;2-5 business days</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_r7dYmT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will I be charged customs or import fees?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We have printing partners in the USA, UK, the Netherlands, and Australia. If you are in one of those locations, your order will be printed locally and will not attract any duties or customs fees. Canadian orders ship from the USA and may be subject to a 5% GST charge on delivery. For all other countries, printed books are generally not subject to import duty, though some countries may apply local taxes on imported goods.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LeYwVk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your money back guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We promise you'll be happy with our 100% risk-free \"<strong>Love it or we'll make it right</strong>\"<strong>12-month happiness guarantee</strong>. If you're not happy with your order for any reason, contact us and we'll do everything we can to make it right. If you're still not satisfied, let us know within 12 months for a full refund, including return shipping.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BfR8m6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do your books feel as good as they look?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! Every book is professionally printed on thick, high-quality paper with vibrant colors and a finish that feels as special as it looks. Don’t take our word for it: <a href=\"/pages/testimonials\">read what families say</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6QrqTw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I ship to a PO Box?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we can ship to PO Boxes in the USA, UK, Canada and Australia. For express shipping or orders to all other countries, please use a residential or business address, as courier services cannot deliver to PO Boxes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4GTTCw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I ship to an APO/FPO address?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We're terribly sorry, but our US printer doesn't ship to military addresses.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YYC4wD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I personalize a book?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Click the \"Personalize your book\" button below the book cover, enter your child's name, and choose your format. It takes less than a minute.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xEi68P": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer discounts?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we have a launch promotion (automatically added at checkout):<br/>&nbsp; &nbsp;• First 25 customers get 50% off</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UE6kMi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I track my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Once your order has been printed and dispatched, you'll receive your tracking number via email. Visit our <a href=\"https://www.piccopuppy.com/apps/tracking\" target=\"_blank\">tracking page</a> and look it up using the tracking number from your shipping email, or your order number and email address.</p><p>If you don't see the shipping email, check your spam folder. If it's not there either, contact us and we'll send it again.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PPHiUk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Picco Puppy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Picco Puppy is an indie children's picture book publisher founded by award-winning author Michael Wong. Since 2020, our books have delighted over 450,000 customers worldwide and earned over 3,000 five-star ratings on Amazon.</p><p>Based in Sydney, Australia, Picco Puppy partners with printers in the US, UK, the Netherlands, and Australia. Your book prints close to home, which means faster and more affordable shipping and support for local businesses along the way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Nj6n69": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will you add more books for personalization?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! We'll soon add these titles:</p><p>In production:</p><ul><li><em>Dear Daughter</em></li><li><em>Dear Son</em></li></ul><p>Unconditional Love Series:</p><ul><li><em>I Wish You A Happy Birthday</em></li><li><em>I Will Always Be Proud of You</em></li><li><em>I Will Always Love You</em></li><li><em>Never Give Up On Your Dreams</em></li><li><em>Share The Kindness In Your Heart</em></li><li><em>Be The Best You Can Be</em></li><li><em>I Love You With All My Heart</em></li><li><em>I Will Always Believe In You</em></li></ul><p>Later</p><ul><li><em>Grandma's Timeless Wisdom</em></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EakCtp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I have a question. How do I contact Picco Puppy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Visit the <a href=\"/pages/support\" title=\"Shipping/Support\">Support</a> page for more answers to your questions. If you need support, reach our via the Help chat box in the bottom-right corner, the contact us form at the bottom of the support page, or email at <a href=\"mailto:help@piccopuppy.com\">help@piccopuppy.com</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WLAFcQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your books available for personalization in different languages?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>French, Spanish, German, and Italian editions are coming in 2027, in both single-language and English-bilingual formats. <a href=\"https://www.piccopuppy.com/pages/giveaways\" target=\"_blank\">Sign up to our newsletter</a> to be the first to know.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
